# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building on the momentum established across the v2.x series, which has centered on positioning Qiskit as the leading platform for hybrid quantum-HPC workflows, [Qiskit SDK v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) delivers a significant expansion of the C API alongside faster, more flexible tools for building and optimizing quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "Membangun momentum yang telah dibentuk di seluruh seri v2.x, yang berfokus pada memposisikan Qiskit sebagai platform terdepan untuk alur kerja hybrid quantum-HPC, [Qiskit SDK v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) menghadirkan perluasan signifikan pada C API bersamaan dengan alat yang lebih cepat dan fleksibel untuk membangun dan mengoptimalkan quantum circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Major updates include:\n"
msgstr "  Pembaruan utama meliputi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom transpiler passes in C** - Write custom transpiler passes through Qiskit's C API using the new `QkDag` object and an expanded `QkTarget` object, which enable step-by-step inspection, modification, and extension of the compilation process - without rebuilding the entire compiler pipeline.\n"
msgstr "**Pass transpiler kustom dalam C** - Tulis pass transpiler kustom melalui C API Qiskit menggunakan objek `QkDag` baru dan objek `QkTarget` yang diperluas, yang memungkinkan pemeriksaan, modifikasi, dan perluasan proses kompilasi langkah demi langkah - tanpa membangun ulang seluruh pipeline compiler.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Faster hardware layout selection** - Upgrades and Rust-driven performance enhancements to `VF2Layout` and `VF2PostLayout` improve the speed and scalability of circuit-to-hardware layout selection, reducing compilation overhead and improving fidelity on quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "**Pemilihan layout hardware yang lebih cepat** - Peningkatan dan peningkatan performa berbasis Rust pada `VF2Layout` dan `VF2PostLayout` meningkatkan kecepatan dan skalabilitas pemilihan layout circuit-ke-hardware, mengurangi overhead kompilasi dan meningkatkan fidelitas pada hardware kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New multi-qubit Pauli measurement** - The new `PauliProductMeasurement` instruction enables joint projective measurement across multiple qubits in a single operation, unlocking compilation to Pauli-based computation - a common representation in fault-tolerant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "**Pengukuran Pauli multi-qubit baru** - Instruksi `PauliProductMeasurement` baru memungkinkan pengukuran proyektif bersama di beberapa qubit dalam satu operasi, membuka kompilasi ke Pauli-based computation - sebuah representasi umum dalam komputasi kuantum fault-tolerant.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Improvements in early fault-tolerant transpilation** - Performance and feature enhancements for transpilation to early fault-tolerant targets - especially Clifford+T targets - help users more efficiently build transpilation pipelines for future QPUs.\n"
msgstr "**Peningkatan pada transpilasi early fault-tolerant** - Peningkatan performa dan fitur untuk transpilasi ke target early fault-tolerant - khususnya target Clifford+T - membantu pengguna membangun pipeline transpilasi untuk QPU masa depan dengan lebih efisien.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  These capabilities give developers greater flexibility to customize quantum circuit optimizations and integrate with existing HPC workflows. [Visit the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) for the full technical summary.\n"
msgstr "  Kemampuan-kemampuan ini memberikan pengembang fleksibilitas lebih besar untuk menyesuaikan optimasi quantum circuit dan mengintegrasikan dengan alur kerja HPC yang sudah ada. [Kunjungi blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) untuk ringkasan teknis lengkap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wondering what has changed? Read the [changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) and the [v2.3 release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.3).\n"
msgstr "Penasaran apa yang berubah? Baca [changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) dan [catatan rilis v2.3](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.3).\n"

